WEBVTT

00:35:55.538 --> 00:36:01.746
those bridges between those two fan bases
? And what were your findings? In summary
,

00:36:01.954 --> 00:36:03.413
I'm so glad that resonated.

00:36:03.413 --> 00:36:07.038
You know, I was I was when thinking
about the prejudice that

00:36:07.663 --> 00:36:09.954
so many people hold toward other groups,

00:36:10.413 --> 00:36:12.829
I was looking for a context
where we could study it,

00:36:13.246 --> 00:36:17.871
where the actual stakes are minimal, but
the emotional stakes feel very high.

00:36:18.413 --> 00:36:22.204
And sports fan allegiances, it just it
felt like the perfect place to go.

00:36:22.996 --> 00:36:24.788
I mean, a few years ago, I got to know

00:36:24.788 --> 00:36:27.996
an amazing woman in her 70s who
helps Holocaust survivors.

00:36:28.538 --> 00:36:30.788
And one day she mentioned that
she went to Ohio State.